WEBVTT

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:00.570
SW: Again.

00:04:00.570 --> 00:04:03.000
E: Happy birthday to you.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.000
SW: Big finish.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.000
E: Happy birthday to you.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.000
SW: Good job!

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:13.000
(Applause)

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:17.450
Well, before we wrap it up, 
she would like to give a shout out

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:20.000
to all our animal friends 
back at the Knoxville Zoo.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.421
Einstein, do you want 
to say "hi" to all the owls?

00:04:22.421 --> 00:04:23.410
E: Woo, woo, woo.

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:25.000
SW: What about the other birds?

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:26.000
E: Tweet, tweet, tweet.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.000
SW: And the penguin?

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:27.820
E: Quack, quack, quack.

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:29.000
SW: There we go.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:30.000
(Laughter)

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.280
Let's get that one out of there. 
How about a chimpanzee?